    <item>
      <title>Thunderstorm Advisory No. 1 #SLPRSD</title>
      <description>Thunderstorm Advisory No. 1 #SLPRSD&lt;br /&gt; Issued at 04:45 AM 08 September 2026&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Moderate to occasionally heavy rainshowers with lightning and strong winds are expected over #Masbate(Aroroy, Baleno, Mandaon), #Albay(LegazpiCity, Daraga, Manito) and #Sorsogon(Pilar) within the next 1 to 2 hours.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; The above conditions are being experienced in #Masbate(SanPascual, Claveria), #Romblon(Romblon, Cajidiocan, SanFernando, Magdiwang), #OrientalMindoro(Bulalacao, Mansalay, Roxas and Bongabong) which may persist within 1 to 2 hours and may affect nearby areas.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; All are advised to take precautionary measures against the impacts associated with these hazards which include flash floods and landslides.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Keep monitoring for updates.</description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 20:55:11 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f25d4075c22ce878cb868027b7137c656aa476dd</guid>
      <category>Thunderstorm Advisory</category>
      <ns0:seen xmlns:ns0="https://pagasa-feeds.local/ns">Mon, 07 Sep 2026 20:55:11 +0000</ns0:seen>
    </item>
